  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Swati Bharadwaj\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                            <a>Swati Bharadwaj</a>\n                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Sep 25, 2026 at 04:27 PM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p><a href=\"/tag/hyderabad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hyderabad</a>: <a href=\"/tag/apollo+hospitals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Apollo Hospitals</a> on Thursday said it has appointed <a href=\"/tag/upasana+kamineni+konidela\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Upasana Kamineni Konidela</a> as <a href=\"/tag/director+of+projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">director of projects</a> to helm planning and delivery of hospital projects as the group embarks on its <a href=\"/tag/rs+8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Rs 8</a>,<a href=\"/tag/600+crore+expansion+programme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">600 crore expansion programme</a> across India.Based in Hyderabad, Konidela will work with Apollo’s leadership, clinicians and project partners on new hospitals, <a href=\"/tag/brownfield+expansions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">brownfield expansions</a> and upgrades to existing facilities.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Apollo Hospitals said she will focus on improving patient-facing design standards, clearer signage and wayfinding, simpler navigation, more efficient clinical spaces and greater comfort for patients and families from design through commissioning. She will also support stronger reporting and coordination across projects.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>Apollo has already announced plans to invest ₹1,565 crore in listed brownfield projects and capacity additions in established markets as well as facilities in growing urban centres such as Hyderabad, Delhi NCR, Chennai, Mumbai, Bengaluru, Lucknow, Varanasi, Indore, Guwahati and Ranchi. However, Apollo did not divulge the specifics of projects and budgets within Upasana’s mandate.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Upasana Konidela said the role continues the vision of her grandfather, Apollo founder Dr Prathap C Reddy, that world-class healthcare should be within reach of people in India.She said hospital design should help patients find their way easily, support families and enable doctors and nurses to deliver care.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Swati Bharadwaj</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Swati Bharadwaj</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Sep 25, 2026 at 04:27 PM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Sep 25, 2026 at 04:27 PM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download the ETHealthworld App</a> and get the Realtime updates and Save your favourite articles.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                                            <!-- <div class=\"app-store-container desktop-view\">\n                            <a href=\"/app\" title=\"\" aria-label=\"Play Store\">\n                                <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-g-play.png\" alt=\"\" />\n                            </a>\n                            <a href=\"/app\" title=\"App Store\">\n                   